#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/038/SubCts651_03890:TEXT_SUBCTS651_03890_SYSTEM_000_131:1"
msgid "You may review the items currently in demand at any time by speaking with Ehll Tou and selecting <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Make a delivery</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なお、「印刷必需品」「印刷必需品の材料」<br>「インクシェル」については、多くの報酬が得られます。<br>リストに含まれていた場合は、積極的に納品してみましょう。
#. de: Besonders große Belohnungen winken bei Druckutensilien, Druckmaterialien und Tintenmuscheln. Falls sie auf der Wunschliste stehen, solltest du dich also auf diese Lieferungen konzentrieren.
#. fr: D'autre part, le lot d'imprimerie, le lot d'éléments d'imprimerie et le coquillage encré rapportent une plus grande récompense. Concentrez donc vos efforts sur eux s'ils font partie des objets à livrer<nbsp>!
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/038/SubCts651_03890:TEXT_SUBCTS651_03890_SYSTEM_000_132:1"
msgid "Note that printing essentials, printing materials, and inkshells will earn you particularly handsome rewards. Whenever they make an appearance, the effort to procure them will be worth your while."
msgstr ""

#. ja: さらに、新たなクエストが発行されました！<br>「聖ロエル広場」の「オーディロン」から、<br>話を聞いてみましょう。
#. de: Bei Hautdilong im Genist ist ein neuer Auftrag verfügbar.
#. fr: Enfin, une nouvelle quête est disponible<nbsp>! Parlez à Hautdilong à l'estrade de Sainte Roelle pour l'accepter.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/038/SubCts651_03890:TEXT_SUBCTS651_03890_SYSTEM_000_133:1"
msgid "A new quest is available from Hautdilong in the New Nest. "
msgstr ""
